    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University faculty are working alongside Pakistan's health ministry, UNICEF, WHO, the Pakistan Paediatric Association and a range of public and private hospitals to prepare clinical guidelines to ensure children with the coronavirus receive treatment suited to their age and needs.",
